/*
 * SPDX-FileCopyrightText: nirapod-slhdsa contributors
 * SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
 *
 * hash.jazz
 * =========
 *
 * Extraction entry for the hash-function correctness proofs. It contains no
 * code of its own: it requires the production SHA-2 and sponge sources, so
 * that jasmin2ec extracts their functions from the source files themselves,
 * under the include roots of each (architecture, variant). HMAC, MGF1, the
 * FIPS 202 functions and the multi-way code are not extracted.
 * `make -C proofs extract` runs it; see proofs/README.md.
 */

from Hash require "sha2/sha256.jinc"
from Hash require "sha2/sha512.jinc"
from Hash require "keccak/sponge.jinc"
